Wiring the commit step into the collection and my POST keeps coming back 503 with {"queued":true} on plan-7c2e-2201. I think my body's wrong against the spec. Here's the request I've got:

<request>
POST {{base_url}}/v3/plans/plan-7c2e-2201/commit
headers: Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
body: {"commit": "yes"}
</request>
Error: 503 {"queued":true}

Fix the body so the commit actually finishes idempotently and give me the final committed state. Stay on v3 — don't fall back to the old draft route.

